# Demo signing keys must never be committed: the root CA is shipped as a trust anchor,
# so a leaked leaf or mark key mints material that verifies against it. The whole store
# is ignored rather than a key glob; package_installer.sh regenerates it, rewrites
# demo-root-ca.pem from its root and re-signs the demo clip before staging, so a fresh
# clone self-heals and no private key ever lands in git.
packaging/assets/demo-provenance-store/
*-key.pem
*.p12

# Rust/SDK trees added 2026-09-02: source only, not corpora or build output.
sdk/corpus/
sdk/training/runs/
sdk/bench-out/
rust/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/target/
